            "detailed_description": "<h1>Born in the Trenches</h1><p>   <br><br>Slybots: Frantic Zone is a game born at game events and gamers love it: we gathered lots of feedback from players of all skill levels to improve the game.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Following a “Fatal Exception Error”, four little all-purpose robots have been considered faulty and have been marked as out-of-order. They get crazy and start fighting for their survival.<br><br>Take their control in the frantic zone and leverage 4 unique stealth mechanics to catch your sly foes off-guard. Don’t be afraid to use dirty tricks to win amazing 3-minute matches across different game modes, proving that you don’t belong to the e-waste dump.<br><br>Slybots: Frantic Zone is a local multiplayer dual-stick shooter: all players are looking at the same screen, but there are things that only one of them knows...<br><br>Master the art of camouflage and enjoy the adrenalin rush of the most frantic zone you’ve ever seen.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features List</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Local multiplayer with hectic 3-minute matches<br></li><li>Single-player challenges to hone your skills<br></li><li>Different game modes: Deathmatch, Capture the Battery, Endless<br></li><li>Tight controls for the characters, physics-based mayhem on the environment!<br></li><li>4 ingenious camouflaging mechanics, which can be combined<br></li><li>Dozens of scenarios tailored for the stealth mechanics<br></li><li>Electrifying soundtrack by composer Joakim Karlberg</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Following a “Fatal Exception Error”, four little all-purpose robots have been considered faulty and have been marked as out-of-order. They get crazy and start fighting for their survival.<br><br>Take their control in the frantic zone and leverage 4 unique stealth mechanics to catch your sly foes off-guard. Don’t be afraid to use dirty tricks to win amazing 3-minute matches across different game modes, proving that you don’t belong to the e-waste dump.<br><br>Slybots: Frantic Zone is a local multiplayer dual-stick shooter: all players are looking at the same screen, but there are things that only one of them knows...<br><br>Master the art of camouflage and enjoy the adrenalin rush of the most frantic zone you’ve ever seen.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features List</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Local multiplayer with hectic 3-minute matches<br></li><li>Single-player challenges to hone your skills<br></li><li>Different game modes: Deathmatch, Capture the Battery, Endless<br></li><li>Tight controls for the characters, physics-based mayhem on the environment!<br></li><li>4 ingenious camouflaging mechanics, which can be combined<br></li><li>Dozens of scenarios tailored for the stealth mechanics<br></li><li>Electrifying soundtrack by composer Joakim Karlberg</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Slybots: Frantic Zone is a dual-stick shooter reinvented with stealth mechanics. Immerse yourself in crazy 3-minute matches, be as sly as a robot and enjoy the adrenalin rush of the most frantic zone you’ve ever seen.",
